# Play test of Saltpan Delta (CIPlay saltpan_delta, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the works at
# 1.5 m; the pump house's veranda x -34.5..-31, z 41.5..52 (open to the south), the zone by the pump at -29 45; the pans
# x -31..-19 (north z 31, middle 18, south 5), the crank posts at x -22; the salt store x -41..-38, z 2..5, its doorway
# east; the wagon at -25 -9 and its brake; the jetty (deck 1.5 m) and the shipping office x -33..-30, z -51..-48
island Saltpan Delta
offset 0.822 -0.6864
expect step 0
expect title The Last Harvest
expect animals Chicken 3
expect animals Goat 2
expect animals Dolphin 2
expect hidden salt1
wait 5

# The pump house: the notice, the crank in the foreman's locker
walk -33 37 to -33 40.5 to -33 44 h=1.5
zone pumphouse
expect step 1
read Foreman's notice
expect step 2
open Foreman's locker
expect story crank 1
expect step 3

# The pans in turn, north to south; the middle one first is refused
use crank2
expect message North sluice first
use crank1
wait 10
expect shown salt1
use salt1
expect story saltsack 1
expect step 4
use crank2
wait 10
expect shown salt2
use salt2
expect story saltsack 2
expect step 5
# The salt store by the south pan: the rats
walk -33 3.5 to -36.5 3.5 h=1.5
zone saltstore
kill Rat
expect step 6
open Salt store box
use crank3
wait 10
expect shown salt3
use salt3
expect story saltsack 3
expect step 7

# The wagon loaded; the brake off - the ride down the line to the jetty; the pay chest in the shipping office
use wagon
expect story waybill 1
expect step 8
use brake
wait 13
expect step 9
open Jetty barrel
walk -25 -52 to -29 -50 h=1.5
open Works pay chest
expect done
